1
00:00:00,149 --> 00:00:02,441
Google just started writing part of your ads

2
00:00:02,461 --> 00:00:03,686
And you can't edit it

3
00:00:03,828 --> 00:00:05,553
It's live in four countries

4
00:00:05,573 --> 00:00:09,133
The US UK Australia and India

5
00:00:09,216 --> 00:00:10,658
It's called a review summary

6
00:00:10,678 --> 00:00:13,531
Google's AI reads your reviews across the web

7
00:00:13,567 --> 00:00:15,512
and writes one line into your ad

8
00:00:15,594 --> 00:00:16,954
Picture your bakery's ad

9
00:00:16,974 --> 00:00:18,180
You wrote the headline

10
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,280
Google writes the line inside it

11
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,390
You can't change a word and Google hasn't

12
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:24,084
said how to switch it off

13
00:00:24,149 --> 00:00:25,509
Here's the part that got me

14
00:00:25,529 --> 00:00:26,782
It's positive only

15
00:00:26,802 --> 00:00:28,716
And it shows up only when Google predicts

16
00:00:28,736 --> 00:00:30,162
your ad will do better

17
00:00:30,294 --> 00:00:32,499
So your reviews are now your ad copy

18
00:00:32,594 --> 00:00:34,496
So stop polishing headlines

19
00:00:34,516 --> 00:00:36,902
Ask happy customers to say exactly what they

20
00:00:36,922 --> 00:00:39,492
loved because that's what Google writes from
